// Region-scoped mock analytics for the dashboard (master + per-region drill-down).
// Single source of truth: every Box 1–7 value on /dashboard/region/[code] and the
// master page's map/table read from here. Country/region datasets are generated by
// deterministically scaling the global baseline (share factors consistent with the
// activity map's country data and the slide-6 table: APAC 56% / NA 29% / EU 24% /
// LATAM 10% / MEA 5%) with small per-metric jitter so pages don't look copy-pasted.
// Numbers stay internally consistent: users sum ≈ 248.5K signed up, the viewers /
// gamified splits match the master table, and the map, master row, and region strips agree.

